* 1N4148 switching diode
*****************************************************************************
* Parameters are copied UNMODIFIED from the 1N4148 subcircuit that ships
* inside the Texas Instruments TLC555 PSpice library in the ngspice tree:
*
*   C:\ngspice\examples\probe\TLC555.LIB
*   lines 381-386 (ngspice 47)
*
* (C) Copyright 2011 Texas Instruments Incorporated. All rights reserved.
* The parent TLC555 library is provided by TI on an "as is" basis.
*
* This file contains ONLY the 1N4148 subcircuit from that library.
* No diode parameters were invented or fitted for Physical AI.
*****************************************************************************
*
* Source part: TLC555 all-in-one PSpice model
* Released by: Analog eLab Design Center, Texas Instruments Inc.
* Date in parent file: 13JUN2011
* Simulator: PSPICE
*
*****************************************************************************

.SUBCKT 1N4148 1 2
D1          1 2  D_1N4148_1
.MODEL D_1N4148_1 D( IS=1N N=1.7 BV=75 IBV=5U RS=2M
+      CJO=4P VJ=750M M=330M FC=500M TT=25.9N
+      EG=1.11 XTI=3 KF=0 AF=1 )
.ENDS
